<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>JBStudentHub | Home</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f7fa;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header {
      background: #0056b3;
      color: white;
      padding: 30px 0;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    header p {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-top: 5px;
    }

    nav {
      background: #004494;
      padding: 12px 0;
    }
    nav a {
      color: white;
      margin: 0 15px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    nav a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .intro {
      padding: 30px 20px;
      font-size: 17px;
      color: #333;
    }

    .card-container {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 25px;
      width: 250px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      transition: 0.3s;
    }
    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
    }
    .card a {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #0056b3;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .card p {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #555;
    }

    footer {
      background: #ddd;
      padding: 15px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>📚 JBStudentHub</h1>
  <p>Your all‑in‑one hub for learning, sharing & growing 🚀</p>
</header>

<nav>
  <a href="#file">File Sharing</a>
  <a href="#resources">Resources</a>
  <a href="#podcast">Podcast</a>
  <a href="#help">Help & Support</a>
</nav>

<div class="intro">
  Welcome! Whether you’re here for study content, community insight, or the latest JB Podcast, we’ve got you covered.
</div>

<div class="card-container">
  <div class="card">
    <a id="file" href="#">📁 File Sharing</a>
    <p>Share and access documents, PDFs and student files quickly.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <a id="resources" href="#">📚 Resources</a>
    <p>Find tutorials, study materials and helpful guides.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <a id="podcast" href="#">🎙️ Podcast</a>
    <p>Listen to motivational and insightful episodes from JB Podcast.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <a id="help" href="#">🛠 Help & Support</a>
    <p>Need help using the site? We’re here for you.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>
  © 2025 JBStudentHub | Powered by JB STUDios
</footer>

</body>
</html>
```

